# Model sources

The editable model goes here, one file per tool:

- `{{ model_slug }}.mdl` — Vensim
- `{{ model_slug }}.stmx` — Stella

This directory holds **structure only**: stocks, flows, equations, causal
links. Parameter values, lookup tables and scenario overrides belong in
`models/config/`, so that a scenario change is a one-line diff instead of a rewrite
of the model file.

Exports generated from these sources (`.vpmx`, PySD `.py`) go in
`../export/`, never here.
